# Generic Institutional Operating System (IOS)

## Purpose

This reference implementation provides a country-neutral Institutional Operating System (IOS) architecture that any government, development finance institution, multilateral organization, or public sector reform programme can adapt.

Unlike country-specific examples, this model focuses on universal institutional capabilities rather than specific organizations.

---

# Institutional Operating System

```
Citizens
        ↓
Identity Infrastructure
        ↓
Digital Public Infrastructure
        ↓
Public Finance
        ↓
Procurement
        ↓
Government Services
        ↓
Institutional Memory
        ↓
National Capability
        ↓
Industrial Competitiveness
```

